Value Required slot (\d+)
Value Required cpu (\d+)
Value cpu_5s_percent (\d+)
Value cpu_1m_percent (\d+)
Value cpu_usage_percent (\d+)

Start
  ^\s*Slot ${slot} CPU ${cpu} CPU usage:
  ^\s*${cpu_5s_percent}% in last 5 seconds
  ^\s*${cpu_1m_percent}% in last 1 minute
  ^\s*${cpu_usage_percent}% in last 5 minutes -> Record

EOF
